<title>USA: Advanta Corp names president.</title>
<headline>Advanta Corp names president.</headline>
<dateline>SPRING HOUSE, Pa. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanta Corp said on Monday that David Brooks, currently executive vice president of VISA USA, was named president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>His appointment immediately follows the resignation of Richard Greenawalt, who has accepted a position as chief executive officer of Olympic Financial Ltd, a Minneapolis-based auto lender, Advanta said.</p>
<p>Brooks is expected to assume his new post by the end of this month, Advanta said.</p>
